message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper, \"Comparing protein conformational ensembles across sequences and lengths\" (submitted), and this software."
title: "framedchain-paper: analysis code for \"Comparing protein conformational ensembles across sequences and lengths\""
version: 1.3.1
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: "Analysis code exactly as run for the paper \"Comparing protein conformational ensembles across sequences and lengths\": the scripts that produced every number, figure and table, with the run queues, environment records, checksum records and the time-stamped records that fixed each analysis before it was run."
